  {
   "id": "g2",
   "type": "group",
   "label": "2 · Доставка трафика",
   "x": 860,
   "y": -60,
   "width": 1120,
   "height": 780,
   "children": [
    "cdn",
    "lb",
    "gateway",
    "media",
    "s3"
   ],
   "color": "2"
  },
  {
   "id": "g1",
   "type": "group",
   "label": "1 · Спрос и сценарии",
   "x": 0,
   "y": -60,
   "width": 860,
   "height": 900,
   "children": [
    "assumptions",
    "mode",
    "traffic",
    "peak"
   ],
   "color": "1"
  },
  {
   "id": "hint",
   "type": "text",
   "text": "E-commerce Capacity Model\nПолный расчётный контур: спрос → доставка (CDN/LB/Gateway) → доменные сервисы (OMS, WMS, TMS, ERP, платежи) → данные (SQL/NoSQL/Kafka/воркеры) → мощность → стоимость.\nБаза — обычный день. Сценарии «Чёрная пятница ×3» и «×5» уже в файле: **Ctrl+Shift+I** → чипы сценариев → «Сравнить». Узкие места — **Ctrl+B**.",
   "x": 0,
   "y": -260,
   "width": 620,
   "height": 200,
   "color": "4"
  },
  {
   "id": "assumptions",
   "type": "text",
   "text": "Допущения\nБаза — обычный день. Единственное место с ручными числами: правьте здесь, дальше всё проливается по value-связям.\n\nvisitors_day = 800000\npages_per_visit = 12\napi_per_page = 4\npeak_factor = 2.5\norders_day = 20000\nitems_per_order = 2.5\nsku_count = 120000",
   "x": 40,
   "y": 120,
   "width": 330,
   "height": 380,
   "color": "5"
  },
  {
   "id": "mode",
   "type": "text",
   "text": "Режим\nМножитель нагрузки к обычному дню. What-if сценарии подменяют эту строку: Чёрная пятница ×3 и ×5.\n\nmult = 1",
   "x": 40,
   "y": 580,
   "width": 330,
   "height": 220,
   "color": "3"
  },
  {
   "id": "traffic",
   "type": "text",
   "text": "Трафик\nАудитория → страницы → API-вызовы. Средний поток и обычный пиковый час.\n\napi_day = Допущения.visitors_day × Допущения.pages_per_visit × Допущения.api_per_page\navg_rps = api_day × 1 rps / 86400\npeak_rps = avg_rps × Допущения.peak_factor",
   "x": 460,
   "y": 120,
   "width": 330,
   "height": 260,
   "color": "2"
  },
  {
   "id": "peak",
   "type": "text",
   "text": "Пик\nРасчётный поток под активный сценарий: средний день × пиковый час × множитель режима. Этим значением питается весь ландшафт.\n\ndesign_rps = Трафик.avg_rps × Допущения.peak_factor × Режим.mult",
   "x": 460,
   "y": 470,
   "width": 330,
   "height": 230,
   "color": "2"
  },
  {
   "id": "cdn",
   "type": "text",
   "text": "rps = 1111.11 rps\ncache_hit = 0.8\norigin_latency = 2 ms",
   "x": 900,
   "y": 120,
   "width": 300.0,
   "height": 208,
   "color": "2",
   "canvasdesk": {
    "template": {
     "id": "com.canvasdesk.cdn",
     "version": "1.2.0",
     "expr": "mm1($rps × (1 - $cache_hit), 1 req / $origin_latency)",
     "params": {
      "rps": {
       "num": 1111.11,
       "unit": "rps"
      },
      "cache_hit": {
       "num": 0.8
      },
      "origin_latency": {
       "num": 2,
       "unit": "ms"
      }
     },
     "icon": "http",
     "color": "#7ED321",
     "name": "CDN",
     "outputs": [
      {
       "name": "origin_rps",
       "unit": "rps",
       "expr": "$rps × (1 - $cache_hit)"
      },
      {
       "name": "utilization",
       "unit": "%",
       "expr": "utilization($rps × (1 - $cache_hit), 1 req / $origin_latency)"
      }
     ]
    },
    "title": "CDN"
   }
  },
  {
   "id": "lb",
   "type": "text",
   "text": "connections_per_sec = 222.222 rps\nserver_rate = 400 rps\nservers = 3\nauth_share = 0.06\nfeed_share = 0.7\nmedia_share = 0.24",
   "x": 1280,
   "y": 100,
   "width": 360.0,
   "height": 286,
   "color": "2",
   "canvasdesk": {
    "template": {
     "id": "com.canvasdesk.tcp-lb",
     "version": "1.2.0",
     "expr": "mm1($connections_per_sec, $server_rate, $servers)",
     "params": {
      "connections_per_sec": {
       "num": 222.222,
       "unit": "rps"
      },
      "server_rate": {
       "num": 400,
       "unit": "rps"
      },
      "servers": {
       "num": 3
      },
      "auth_share": {
       "num": 0.06
      },
      "feed_share": {
       "num": 0.7
      },
      "media_share": {
       "num": 0.24
      }
     },
     "icon": "lb",
     "color": "#7ED321",
     "name": "TCP-балансировщик",
     "outputs": [
      {
       "name": "out_gateway",
       "unit": "rps",
       "expr": "$connections_per_sec"
      },
      {
       "name": "out_auth",
       "unit": "rps",
       "expr": "$connections_per_sec × $auth_share"
      },
      {
       "name": "out_feed",
       "unit": "rps",
       "expr": "$connections_per_sec × $feed_share"
      },
      {
       "name": "out_media",
       "unit": "rps",
       "expr": "$connections_per_sec × $media_share"
      },
      {
       "name": "utilization",
       "unit": "%",
       "expr": "utilization($connections_per_sec, $server_rate, $servers)"
      }
     ]
    },
    "title": "Балансировщик L4"
   }
  },
  {
   "id": "gateway",
   "type": "text",
   "text": "rps = 155.556 rps\nlatency_budget = 10 ms\nauth_overhead = 8 ms",
   "x": 1660,
   "y": 120,
   "width": 300.0,
   "height": 208,
   "color": "1",
   "canvasdesk": {
    "template": {
     "id": "com.canvasdesk.api-gateway",
     "version": "1.2.0",
     "expr": "mm1($rps, 1 req / ($latency_budget - $auth_overhead))",
     "params": {
      "rps": {
       "num": 155.556,
       "unit": "rps"
      },
      "latency_budget": {
       "num": 10,
       "unit": "ms"
      },
      "auth_overhead": {
       "num": 8,
       "unit": "ms"
      }
     },
     "icon": "gateway",
     "color": "#4A90E2",
     "name": "API-шлюз",
     "outputs": [
      {
       "name": "upstream_rps",
       "unit": "rps",
       "expr": "$rps"
      },
      {
       "name": "effective_service_rate",
       "unit": "rps",
       "expr": "1 req / ($latency_budget - $auth_overhead)"
      },
      {
       "name": "utilization",
       "unit": "%",
       "expr": "utilization($rps, 1 req / ($latency_budget - $auth_overhead))"
      }
     ]
    },
    "title": "API-шлюз"
   }
  },
  {
   "id": "media",
   "type": "text",
   "text": "Медиа\nOrigin-трафик изображений: доля промахов CDN уходит в объектное хранилище.\n\nimg_rps = $1 × 0.8",
   "x": 1280,
   "y": 470,
   "width": 300,
   "height": 190,
   "color": "2"
  },
  {
   "id": "s3",
   "type": "text",
   "text": "requests_per_sec = 42.6667 rps\nlatency = 5 ms\nobject_size = 120 KB",
   "x": 1660,
   "y": 470,
   "width": 300.0,
   "height": 208,
   "color": "3",
   "canvasdesk": {
    "template": {
     "id": "com.canvasdesk.storage-s3",
     "version": "1.0.0",
     "expr": "mm1($requests_per_sec, 1 req / $latency)",
     "params": {
      "requests_per_sec": {
       "num": 42.6667,
       "unit": "rps"
      },
      "latency": {
       "num": 5,
       "unit": "ms"
      },
      "object_size": {
       "num": 120,
       "unit": "KB"
      }
     },
     "icon": "storage",
     "color": "#F5A623",
     "name": "Хранилище (S3)",
     "outputs": []
    },
    "title": "Хранилище (S3)"
   }
  },
  {
   "id": "router",
   "type": "text",
   "text": "Маршрутизация\nДоли потока шлюза по доменным сервисам (в сумме 100%) и операции БД каталога.\n\nin_rps = $1\ncatalog_share = 0.40\nsearch_share = 0.18\ncart_share = 0.14\ncheckout_share = 0.06\naccount_share = 0.05\ncatalog_rps = in_rps × catalog_share\nsearch_rps = in_rps × search_share\ncart_rps = in_rps × cart_share\ncheckout_rps = in_rps × checkout_share\naccount_rps = in_rps × account_share\ncatalog_ops = catalog_rps × 0.8 + search_rps × 1.5",
   "x": 2080,
   "y": 100,
   "width": 360,
   "height": 470,
   "color": "2"
  },
  {
   "id": "oms",
   "type": "text",
   "text": "OMS\nOrder Management: оформление заказа, резервация стока, платёж, события в шину. Заказы масштабируются множителем режима.\n\norder_rps = Допущения.orders_day × 1 rps / 86400 × Режим.mult\nevents_per_order = 6\nevents_rps = order_rps × events_per_order\ndb_write_rps = order_rps × 6\npayments_rps = order_rps × 1.2\nticket_rps = order_rps × 0.04\noms_peak_rps = Маршрутизация.checkout_rps × 3",
   "x": 2080,
   "y": 640,
   "width": 360,
   "height": 380,
   "color": "1"
  },
  {
   "id": "omsapi",
   "type": "text",
   "text": "rps = 9.33333 rps\ntimeout = 30 ms\nstream_window = 64 KB",
   "x": 2560,
   "y": 100,
   "width": 300.0,
   "height": 208,
   "color": "2",
   "canvasdesk": {
    "template": {
     "id": "com.canvasdesk.grpc-service",
     "version": "1.1.0",
     "expr": "mm1($rps, 1 req / $timeout)",
     "params": {
      "rps": {
       "num": 9.33333,
       "unit": "rps"
      },
      "timeout": {
       "num": 30,
       "unit": "ms"
      },
      "stream_window": {
       "num": 64,
       "unit": "KB"
      }
     },
     "icon": "grpc",
     "color": "#7ED321",
     "name": "gRPC-сервис",
     "outputs": [
      {
       "name": "utilization",
